    "text": "Claimants : Saravanabavan Chithranjan, Nallur and Regional Director of Health Service, Jaffna. All persons interested in the aforesaid Land on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Sandilipay on the 29th April 2025 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 15th April 2025, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
